===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description          ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi           | 192.168.1.1/24           |
| eth0             | LAN port             | None                     |
| eth1             | WAN port             | DHCP                     |
| wlan0            | WiFi (5 GHz)         | Disabled                 |
| wlan1            | WiFi (2 GHz)         | Disabled                 |
| wlan2            | WiFi (5 GHz)         | Disabled                 |

==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
Port 0 is the internal CPU port and should be tagged.
Ports 1 to 3 are unused.

^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| CPU (internal)   | 0             |
| LAN              | 4             |
| Internet (WAN)   | 5             |

:!: The VLANs 1 and 2 are used internally by the switch, and should not be used. See [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/ipq40xx-switch-config-strangeness/32542?filter=summary|this thread]] for further details.

